-*   `step`: The base sampling step size in world units [S1, unofficial].
-*   `float_epsilon`: A small constant used to determine if a cell is effectively empty [S1, unofficial].
-*   `ADAPTIVE_SAMPLING`: A preprocessor macro that enables or disables the macrocell-based adaptive sampling logic; if defined, the adaptive path is taken, otherwise fixed-step marching is used [S1, unofficial].
